# Otheryia CHANGELOG

---

![](https://otheryia.com/blog-images/1780950193000-gwqg5v.png)

## Big Updates


# ✨ Battlefactory & Battletower Revamped, Pokebuilder Battle IVs & 3,000+ New Emojis! ✨

We’ve got a big update to share, and a lot of things got some love this patch. We’re really excited for you all to dig in!

## ⚔️ Battlefactory Has Been Revamped!

Battles and rewards have been reworked to feel more meaningful and intentional within what the existing battle AI can do. We wanted to give you a system that actually rewards your dedication.

### 🏆 Monthly Leaderboards

There are now monthly leaderboards for the top 3 streak holders, so you’ve finally got something real to work toward!

### 💎 How Rewards Work

* **Win a Round:** Every round you win earns you **1 Battle Point**.
* **Hit a Streak:** Every 5th round earns a bonus **5 Battle Points** on top of the normal reward.
* **Check the Details:** Use `/battlefactory` to see everything!

---

## 🛠️ Battletower Has Also Been Revamped!

No more falling through the floor. No more lag from too many NPCs packed into one area. We heard you, and we fixed it!

### Improvements

* **Smoother Experience:** Performance issues have been ironed out for a much cleaner run.
* **Reworked Rewards:** Each win now gives **$2,500** and **2 Battle Points**.
* **Streak Bonus:** Every 5th round rewards **$5,000** and **5 Battle Points**.

---

## 🔧 Pokebuilder Revamp!

Pokebuilder has been optimized, cleaned up, and made more efficient overall, but the exciting part is the new feature:

### Raise Battle IVs

* You can now raise **Battle IVs** directly in Pokebuilder.
* **Important:** These are **Battle IVs**, not breeding IVs.
* Think of them like **Bottle Caps**, but more accessible.
* They’re priced to cover the gaps that Bottle Caps couldn’t always reach.

This one’s been a long time coming! 🙌

---

## 🎉 New Emojis!

We added a whole bunch (**3,000+**) of new emojis to the server.

Use `/emoji` to browse and go absolutely feral with them. You’re welcome! 😄

---

## ⚠️ Wild Bosses Temporarily Removed

Unfortunately, Wild Bosses had some persistent bugs and performance issues we couldn’t work around right now, so we’ve pulled them for the time being.

The good news? **Version 1.8** is bringing in **Alpha Pokémon**, so that wild encounter energy isn’t going anywhere for long.

Thanks for being here and for your patience as we keep building! 💙

As always, if you run into anything weird, drop it in the **Cobblemon Bug Reports** channel.

---

**Thank you for playing on Otheryia!**
